<Base title="Privacy Policy — Sorgente" description="How Sorgente collects, uses, and protects information when you visit our website or contact us." path="/privacy" bar={false}>
  <section class="privacy-policy">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: October 28, 2026</em></p>
<p>Sorgente ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit our website or contact us through it.</p>
<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<p><strong>Information you provide.</strong> When you fill out a form, request a quote, place an order, sign up for updates, or contact us by phone, email, or message, we may collect details such as your name, email address, phone number, and the content of your message.</p>
<p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, we and our service providers may automatically collect technical information such as your IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, referring website, and the date and time of your visit. This is collected through cookies, analytics tools, and similar technologies.</p>
<h2>How We Use Information</h2>
<ul>
<li>To respond to your inquiries and provide the products or services you request</li>
<li>To schedule appointments, process orders, and communicate with you about them</li>
<li>To operate, maintain, and improve our website and services</li>
<li>To understand how visitors use our website and measure the effectiveness of our marketing</li>
<li>To protect against fraud, abuse, and security issues, and to comply with legal obligations</li>
</ul>
<h2>How We Share Information</h2>
<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share information with trusted service providers who help us operate our website and business (for example, website hosting, analytics, email, scheduling, and payment processing), and only as needed for them to perform those services. We may also disclose information if required by law, to protect our rights, or in connection with a sale or transfer of our business.</p>
<h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
<p>Our website may use cookies and third-party analytics or advertising tools (such as Google Analytics) to understand site traffic and improve your experience. You can set your browser to refuse or delete cookies; some parts of the site may not work as intended if you do. You can learn about opting out of Google Analytics at tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
<p>Our website may link to or embed content from third-party sites and services (such as maps, social media, review platforms, or payment providers). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third parties, and we encourage you to review their privacy policies.</p>
<h2>Data Security and Retention</h2>
<p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect the information we collect. No method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. We keep information only as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy or as required by law.</p>
<h2>Your Choices</h2>
<p>You may request to access, correct, or delete the personal information you have provided to us, or opt out of marketing communications at any time, by contacting us using the information below. You can also unsubscribe from marketing emails using the link included in those emails.</p>
<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>Our website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>
<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date above. Your continued use of the website after changes are posted means you accept the updated policy.</p>
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us by mail or through the contact options listed on this website:</p>
<p>Sorgente<br>[Business Address]</p>
  </section>
</Base>

